WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Find the gap between your harvest and your next planting. Use your local crop calendar. Choose a cover that suits the season, salinity and irrigation available for your field.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.467
Sow one short strip and keep a nearby strip for comparison. Check how evenly the plants establish, how the soil feels near the roots, and how much water each strip uses.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:32.533
Choose your equipment and how you will manage the residue before you sow. Check machine clearance between rows. In a dry field, ending the cover earlier can protect water for the main crop.
